step Into Blackrock Mountain
  zone Searing Gorge
  tip Ride south across the gorge to the long bridge into Blackrock Mountain. Inside, follow the chain walkways down and leave through the southern exit; stay off the paths to the dungeon portals.
  goto 34.8,83.0 "Bridge into Blackrock Mountain"

step Overmaster Pyron
  when onquest 3906
  zone Searing Gorge
  tip With your group: Overmaster Pyron (52, elite) guards the way to the Blackrock Depths portal, down the walkways inside the mountain.
  kill 9026 quest 3906.1 @25.4,80.1 map 1427

step Blackrock Depths
  when dungeon "Blackrock Depths"
  when onquest 4081
  when level>=52
  zone Searing Gorge
  tip Blackrock Depths is a dungeon for a group of five from about level 48, the biggest in the mountain: its Anvilrage dwarves are this quest's, and you need not go further in than they are. Its portal is deep inside the mountain, down the chain walkways from the bridge.
  tip Inside: the Anvilrage Guardsmen, Wardens and Footmen. Then back out of the portal and on through the mountain's southern exit to the Burning Steppes.
  enter "Blackrock Depths" @34.8,85.3
  complete 4081 @34.8,85.3            -- KILL ON SIGHT: Dark Iron Dwarves: the Anvilrage dwarves, inside

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Burning Steppes

